Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,？我们这代人 出生于战争时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}My generation… we were born into war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨兽袭击了我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant monsters attacked our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称之为 怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called 'em Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来自虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came through the Breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往另一次元的入口 位于太平洋的底部\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gateway to another dimension at the bottom of the Pacific Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派它们来的是虫洞另一端的外星种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were sent by an alien race on the other side…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,名为 先驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Precursors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们予以回击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought back,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并造出了我们自己的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}building our own monsters…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaegars…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机器人 体型庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}giant robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要两名驾驶员才能操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So big they needed two pilots to run 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲就是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了拯救世界 牺牲了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sacrificed himself to help save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… am not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.65,0:01:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们赢得战争 并关闭虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been ten years since we won the war…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.85,0:01:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过去了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}and closed the Breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分地区已经重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the world's recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一些沿海城市从未改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a few coastal cities never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个世界仍在休养生息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the world is still picking up the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们中的一些人更愿意住在废墟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some of us live better in a broken world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在断壁残垣的豪宅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And squatting in half a mansion…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比买那些海景公寓强\N{\fnArial\fs30}is better than paying for some crappy apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在救援区 你得生财有道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, in the relief zones, you have to get creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,会做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则别人会吃掉你的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or somebody else might eat your breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有紧俏的辣椒酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your damn hot sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 我们赋予物品不同的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, out here, we place a different value on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而「环太平洋联合军防部队」通常不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pan Pacific Defense Corps usually looks the other way…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你别去那些不该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as you don't go poking around where you don't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如退役机甲的废料场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, like a decommissioned Jaeger scrapyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚 圣塔莫尼卡）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说 富贵险中求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big risks mean big reward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗取机甲技术是最赚钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing pays more than stolen Jaeger tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 很多疯子都想组装自己的机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of nutcases out here trying to slap together their own Jaegers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们得有零件才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they need the parts to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能偷到别人偷不到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you can steal what no one else can steal…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能过上国王般的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can live like a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这里有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,报废前 动力核心都会被拆掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power cores are stripped before they get decommissioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过偶尔会忘掉三级等离子电容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes they miss the tertiary plasma capacitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能性很大 你看这个 你还有电\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a big score. This one's still holding a charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just calm down. Let's not get excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just playing the odds here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在华雷斯骗了布雷塔 在香港又把老周耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cheated Barada in Juarez, skipped out on Chau in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是误会 - 还在我的后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, that was a misunderstanding. - And stole from me…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my own backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在我是为你而偷 低头不见抬头见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm stealing for you. Circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 交个朋友怎么样 - 你先把东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We good? - You deliver…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们发财去 - 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get rich. - Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 出了点状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, uh, just a little situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿说它在那儿 它就应该在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says it's here. It's supposed to be right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也看到这种状况了 我来看看是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know what, let me just figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个人给我把他干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please kill this guy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 它在这儿 你等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's here. You wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,电容器让他拿走了 我们追 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else has the capacitor. Now, let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.33,0:04:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boss, he went over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see him. I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, Jake, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真滑头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:05:58.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 请勿靠近此门）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, you son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get back here with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标正在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:33.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帮助打赢这场仗 怪兽袭击加剧）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怪兽之战结束）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邵氏酝酿技术收购）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第六代机甲）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你多大了 - 打败你绰绰有余\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you? - Old enough to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a second. Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是你造的吗 - 你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You build this thing yourself? - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为可以卖掉你的小玩具 赚一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can sell your little toy for a whole lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手可不是玩具 它是非卖品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper's not a toy and she's not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁手里拿着棍子谁说了算 你给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man holding the pipe says she is. So listen up…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你把他们领来的 - 怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You led them here? - {\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, what the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 住手 - 它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no, no, no, no. Stop! - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Don't touch that. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一个在哪 - 住手 另一个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the other one? - Stop! The other what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个驾驶位 机甲需要两名驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other cradle. A Jaeger needs two pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手是小机甲 所以一个神经元就能操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper is small enough to run on a single neural lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你出去 我来驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then you get out, you let me pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 它不是玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you she's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死我们的 我能让我们逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get us killed. I can get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经让我们逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:03.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（接近警戒目标 警告）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是「冬日阿贾克斯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's November Ajax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经注册的机甲驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilots of unregistered Jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是环太平洋联合军防部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the Pan Pacific Defense Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭动力 并从驾驶舱里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power down and exit your Conn-Pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no. Don't-don't-don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太缺乏斗志了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give up way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反的时候禁止令第14条 驾驶未经注册的机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in violation of Code Ten, Section 14. Operation of an unregistered Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓好 - 我抓着好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on. - I am hanging on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:10:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.73,0:11:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有 我甩掉了冬日阿贾克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I just out-piloted November Ajax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你没有 - 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you didn't. - Did…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你有什么办法 我是不会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What do you got? And I'm not getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能拿掉一个离子电池吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One of those ion cells redundant? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在必须能\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可我们需要它 - 爬到阿贾克斯头上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we need them. - Get up to Ajax's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力不足警报 12%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low power warning. 12%.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我们需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we needed that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们不是成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 11%\N{\fnArial\fs30}11%.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿贾克斯重启系统要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long before Ajax can reboot his systems?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your final warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你对我的机甲都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you did to my Jaeger…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个大傻个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该让我来驾驶的 - 怎么怪起我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should have let me pilot. - Oh, like this is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你暴露了我的指挥中心 - 你的指挥中心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You compromised my command center. - Your command center?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 我的指挥中心 - 等等 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. My command center. - Wait. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没听清 你的指挥中心 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't hear that. Your command center? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼知道你是从哪冒出来的 对我指指点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you had no place to come in and try to tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想怎样就怎样 - 所以结果又怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I go wherever I want. - 'Cause it really worked out well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这世界不一样了 - 看看我们的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a different world. - Look where we're at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的上嘴皮和下嘴皮需要碰面 交个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your top lip and your bottom lip, they need to meet and become friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你厉害 你说的真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart. That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们需要闭上 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to close up, all right? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Yeah, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谈话到此结束 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Conversation done. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡破烂的丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junkyard baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你造它干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是让我把嘴闭上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the shutting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不卖它 那你造它干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wasn't gonna sell it, so what the hell was you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如抢银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob a bank or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找它 是因为它们迟早会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built her because one day they're gonna come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我就不用再傻傻的等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they do, I'm not gonna be stuck waiting…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人来救我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}for someone else to come save my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会像以前那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:24.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪记录）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再谈这事儿 太荒唐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really want to talk about it. It's ridiculous. That's just, like, my right or…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（环太平洋联合军方部队）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又在这儿见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气不好而已 我能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a stretch of bad luck. I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲过去常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father used to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气掌握在自己手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}we make our own luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 老爸说过很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Dad said a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在非法机甲里被当场抓获的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were arrested in a rogue Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 那可不是我的机甲我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second. That wasn't my Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个小不点 大概这么高 - 你有前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's this little kid, she's about this tall… - You have priors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非常严重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 所以才需要我的老姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's why I need my big sis…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从这个地方弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help me get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能就这么让你走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going to let you just walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许有其他的办法 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But there might be another way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 这才是我想听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's what I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想谈这个 别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm here to talk about, the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说吧 需要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay it on me. What do I got to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新入伍 完成你以前的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reenlist and finish what you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我太老了 不适合再当学员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… look, I'm-I'm too old to be a cadet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是让你当学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to be a cadet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是让你去训练他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to help train them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练谁 练什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train who? Train what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想教那些熊孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not training no damn kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输机已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transport is standing by…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要送你们去莫玉兰基地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring both of you to Moyulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的新学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your new recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她居然用视频就把我打发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe she just hologrammed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:58.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（环太平洋联合军防部队猎人学院）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:02.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中国 莫玉兰基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look, I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.19,0:16:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为什么我也要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要我参加这个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do they want me for the program?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己找了个机甲 还能驾驶它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built and piloted your own Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就喜欢你这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people like that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那为什么我只是个学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so then why am I just a cadet…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you get to be a ranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇士欧米茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valor Omega.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是勇士欧米茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, that is Valor Omega.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟我说你回来了 我还不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe it when they told me you were inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样 奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Nate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我兰伯特战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ranger Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在嘲笑我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having a laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是军事基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is a military base.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得这儿的规矩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember how that works,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘特考斯特战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger Pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是阿玛拉·纳马尼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Amara Namani.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去办理报到手续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get you squared away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 在这里你可别偷东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh, try not to steal anything while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙刚才叫你潘特考斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that haircut just call you Pentecost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个了不起的斯塔克·潘特考斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in badass Stacker Pentecost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,探戈狼机甲的驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot of Coyote Tango,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救全世界的大英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hero of basically the whole world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个名字而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 如雷贯耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a really cool name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟训练 六点钟开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sim training starts at 0600.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果迟到 就算旷课一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late, you miss the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果掉队 马上送你上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fall behind, you'll be on the next transport…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿来的回哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to wherever they found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是 救赎者泰坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Titan Redeemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有凤凰游击士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bracer Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要三个人来驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a three-man rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死军刀雅典娜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love Saber Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是所有机甲里最快的 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the fastest Jaeger in the fleet. Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 请远离升降台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning: stand clear of lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 哪个是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so which one's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你驾驶复仇流浪者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pilot Gipsy Avenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他的搭档被私营公司高薪挖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until his copilot got a better offer in the private sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是朱尔斯·雷耶斯 机甲工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jules Reyes, J-Tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿玛拉 学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, cadet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰克 战士 显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake. Ranger, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,久仰大名 潘特考斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard a lot about you, Pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 你还是那个纪录的保持者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you still hold the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}What record?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么把你引诱回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how did they lure you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 肯定不是用钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it couldn't have been the pay, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, it's a long story, but if you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道 我们可以约一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to talk about it, we can meet up…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前看 潘特考斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes front, Pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 蕾娜塔 不要打脸好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Come on, Renata, not the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再押两张淋浴券\N{\fnArial\fs30}And raise you two shower chits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃牌吧 伊利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fold, Ilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再不洗澡就臭死了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need all the showers you can get, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是麝香味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a musk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们闻到的是麝香味\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you smell is musk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:19:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,音频系统停止使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audio system deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,学员们 这是阿玛拉·纳马尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cadets. This is Amara Namani.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上她也参加你们的模拟训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be joining you in sim training bright and early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是潘特考斯特战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Ranger Pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会帮我训练你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be helping me instruct you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我找到新的搭档代替波克战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I can find a new copilot to replace Ranger Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想补充的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you'd like to add?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了你也不爱听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽科娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malikova,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳马尼交给你了 帮她准备明天的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}get Namani squared away and prepped for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘特考斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pentecost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然是潘特考斯特要来训练我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be trained by a Pentecost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不像牺牲自己堵住虫洞的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like he was the one who died helping close the Breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至都没上过战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never even been in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾娜塔 来两局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renata, let's go for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊利亚 看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Ilya, you see this? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where should I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你自己造了个小机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you built your own little Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它叫拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually. Uh, Scrapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是可以单人驾驶的机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I operated her, too, with this solo bay…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想组装垃圾 就去当机械工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to put junk together, be a mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫玉兰是训练驾驶员的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moyulan is for pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我领你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. I got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,津海 欧阳津海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinhai. Ou-yang Jinhai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟维柯算是认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you and Vik already buddies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,维柯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vik?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是维多利亚的简称\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's short for Viktoriya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你应该不想那么叫她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't want to call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她考了三次才通过入学测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took her three shots to pass the entrance test.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以她认为你能来这里是走了捷径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think she likes how you landed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能怪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是走后门进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruiters never come around back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会说俄语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, know any Russian?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我教你几句 好让她消消气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll teach you some. Calms her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我带你熟悉一下这儿的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get you squared away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑半球失去协调 警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hemispheres out of alignment. Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得重新进行对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to reconnect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know! I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁悬浮系统已经关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}MAGLEV deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的适应不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:33.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿玛拉·纳马尼失败 苏雷什·库拉纳失败）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你能把冬日阿贾克斯耍的团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I heard you gave November Ajax a run for his money,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.37,0:21:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为出了个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we might have something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我有些怀疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴这么个破东西怎么对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to drift in this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股脚臭味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听你找借口 学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for your excuses, Cadet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让她对付的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You putting her up against Kaiju…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎能杀死久经沙场的驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}that almost killed veteran pilots…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不合常理\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许除了她 还有人也不适合留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe she's not the only one that doesn't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特 我知道你看我不顺眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. See, Nate, I know you have a problem with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看在她还是个孩子的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on. She's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经也是 这就是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}So were we. That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在年轻时 强化巩固对接形成的默契\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make stronger connections when you're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够造就更好的对接驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that kind of bond makes for a better drift pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我也记得这些 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I remember the pitch.Thanks…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,良一 蕾娜塔 你们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryoichi, Renata, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的新人看看该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show our new recruit how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的那是什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尔斯喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jules loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.99,0:22:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说这里终于来了个型男 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she told me it's nice to finally have someone with style around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能怪人家姑娘 我本来就性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't blame the girl. I'm sexy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰淇淋在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice cream's up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解我 太了解我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你这次又回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, one more time around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:22:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是想证明你老爸说错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove your old man wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:22:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是回来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I just came back to see…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下巴整得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}if your chin implant ever settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.21,0:23:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得整的相当的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think it's settled in quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 看着挺威严的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's very commanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们一定很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids must love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 这些孩子们 他们仰慕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, these kids, they look up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.39,0:23:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,得让他们看看 我们能够通力合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to show them that we can work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 战争十年前就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the war ended ten years ago, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要随它去 就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just need to let that go. Just… woosah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须了解敌人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You have to understand your enemy's ob…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有真正了解敌人的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand your enemy's objective…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道是否打败了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know you've defeated 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 关于这一点我可以告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can help you out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.50,0:23:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它们派怪兽来 无非是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm thinking it has something to do with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人类彻底灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending giant monsters to kick the crap out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先驱如果想让我们从地球上消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. The Precursors wouldn't send Kaiju to flatten a few cities…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会只让怪兽破坏几座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they were trying to wipe us all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 奈特 我对你没有成见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, Nate, I don't have a problem with you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.06,0:23:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我必须作出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had to make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你帅气的脸蛋和监狱之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was between your pretty face and prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了你帅气的脸蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose your pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太感动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I'm touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底还要加多少配料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many damn toppings do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我的配料了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave my toppings be, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扫了我加配料的兴致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mess with my damn toppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 那些学员还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the cadets got, like, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几个月就毕业了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}couple of months before they graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我看这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你想对他们发号施令的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you want to say something soldiery to 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都点头 或者说 没错 按他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just nod, or like, "Yep, what he said."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 不知不觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, before you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就成为驾驶员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they get to be pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.85,0:24:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我也能回到我原有的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I get to get back to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.45,0:24:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.91,0:24:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准你能提前回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may happen sooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.12,0:24:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.19,0:24:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天有场大型展示会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big dog and pony show tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵和她的团队要来展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shao and her team are presenting…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们新研发的自动驾驶系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}this new drone program they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许以后我们就都失业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could make us all obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着像是我的绝地重生之牌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like my "get out of jail free" card.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.88,0:24:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以对想要的一切表现的无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you can front all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you and I both know…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以很伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could've been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.41,0:24:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵小姐 我是权将军
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:24:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.51,0:25:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 邵小姐是从来不握手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. She doesn't do the whole hand shaking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.28,0:25:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邵氏工业研发部的主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Newton Geiszler, head of research…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.30,0:25:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特·葛斯乐博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and development for Shao Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.79,0:25:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手握得 握得很有力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice firm, firm grip you got there, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,握得够紧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您的招待
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和兰伯特战士会马上帮您安排
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来精神多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a much better look on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比穿监狱的囚服强一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's better than prison stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.11,0:25:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没强多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.81,0:25:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 就是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I'm sorry, is this him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他 对吧 你就是斯塔克的孩子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It-It's got to be him, right? You're Stacker's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.65,0:25:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫纽特 是你父亲的铁杆粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, I'm Newt. I was, uh, I was a big fan of your father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.81,0:25:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是一个超级演说家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing speech writer, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.31,0:25:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过他在阻止世界毁灭后的那次演讲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever hear his one where he canceled the apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.97,0:25:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.80,0:25:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望你会跟着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd be tagging along.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在开展一项实验 需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use your help on an experiment I'm working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.58,0:25:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要片刻工夫就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this will only take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你特别忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how busy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.62,0:25:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.12,0:25:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想勉强你 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want to impose, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.37,0:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来 你可勉强不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on, you can't impose on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.85,0:25:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁也不知道谁呀 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've been inside each other's heads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.99,0:25:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和怪兽成功对接了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've drifted with a Kaiju!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.15,0:26:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是我们得到了怪兽大脑中的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we hadn't yanked that intel out of that Kaiju's brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.66,0:26:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗利就不可能把虫洞关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raleigh would've never been able to close the Breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.82,0:26:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是靠你 靠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that was you and that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.44,0:26:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说主要是靠我 可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically more me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们能快点吗 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}but any chance we could make this quick or…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,部署计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.67,0:26:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of Jaegers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.22,0:26:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,部署它们投入战斗 需要花的时间实在是太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploying them into battle, it takes, takes too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The amount of damage…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市就已经被怪兽毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Kaiju can inflict before they've ev…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.46,0:26:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿 我已经有办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, here. I think I've found a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 你知道 我没法读你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann, you know I can never read your, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.43,0:26:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭推进器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, rocket thrusters, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上没有人燃料能达到这个速率\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There's no fuel in the world with that kind of boost-to-mass ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.14,0:26:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.01,0:26:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怪兽的血液吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…Is that Kaiju blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现怪兽的血液在和稀有元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've discovered Kaiju blood is highly reactive…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合时会发生剧烈的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's combined with rare earth elements…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,铈元素 镧元素 钆元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}cerium, lanthanum, gadolinium.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.69,0:26:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了 朋友 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that, pal. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.37,0:26:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别举着它到处闲逛 会炸飞自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You can't be fooling around with this stuff. You're gonna blow yourself up. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:27:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上最了解怪兽形态的只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, no one knows more about Kaiju morphology than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能看上一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you could just take a look, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.69,0:27:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 赫尔曼 我要阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Hermann, I gotta stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, none of this matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.30,0:27:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我老板的无人机甲获得批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once my boss' drones are approved,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.78,0:27:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,部署时间就不是问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}deployment time, that's gonna be a non-issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within a year, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人机甲会遍布各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have drones everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.58,0:27:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不帮我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you won't help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.32,0:27:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如去我家边吃边谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why don't we talk about it over dinner at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.12,0:27:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 你还可以见见艾力丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? You can finally meet Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要一顿热乎乎的饭菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a hot meal, Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的是针对这个问题的解决方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need is a solution to a very specific problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是找我的 朋友 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's me, bud. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.34,0:27:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板在召唤我了 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duty calls. It's been nice catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.39,0:27:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在 做噩梦 梦见和怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still get nightmares about what we saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.46,0:27:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对接时看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we drifted with that…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些恶心的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}disgusting Kaiju brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.77,0:27:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.28,0:27:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一闪就没了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a hell of a rush, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯乐博士 我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.49,0:27:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和哥特里布博士的关系不一般 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.01,0:28:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在打仗那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我们以前
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.35,0:28:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英语
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说中文的时候听起来像个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.29,0:28:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我的中文很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I know, I'm terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.29,0:28:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 以前我们在一个实验室工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes, we shared a lab together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和哥特里布博士刚才在聊什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个疯狂的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, some crazy idea he had about…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想在机甲上装个推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}thruster pods on a, on a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.44,0:28:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在得到森麻子秘书长峰会上的举荐之前
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不允许有任何闪失
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.11,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在投票结果还没出来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.24,0:28:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再和他有任何联系
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 这家伙是完全无害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, the man's completely harmless. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我怀疑你的忠诚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.37,0:28:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你能再说一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you say that again,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次请放慢80%的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this time about 80% slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.52,0:28:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 别让我怀疑你的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't make me question your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.95,0:28:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.81,0:28:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在怀疑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ay. What's to question?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我几乎没跟他说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… look, I barely talk to the guy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.64,0:28:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.97,0:28:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去好好练练你的中文
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.80,0:28:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢重复我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.77,0:28:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是用哪种语言
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的无人机甲是机甲进化的下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}My drones are the next step in Jaeger evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设计的这个系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system I designed processes commands…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过量子数据内核处理指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}through a quantum data core.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着一名驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means that a single pilot…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.61,0:29:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过远程对接 在世界任何地方都可以操作无人机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}can operate the drone remotely from anywhere in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.38,0:29:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要基于森秘书最终报告的部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the council approves deployment,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得委员会的批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}based on Secretary General Mori's final report,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.69,0:29:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些寻找 训练和对接驾驶员的艰难日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the days of struggling to find and train drift compatible pilots…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.92,0:29:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会成为历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为坐办公室的会比我们厉害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think a bunch of desk jockeys are better than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.54,0:29:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来砸人饭碗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not here to shut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.84,0:29:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在至关重要的是我们项目的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooperation between our programs has never been more vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.23,0:29:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还有问题的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there are any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got a question right over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.19,0:29:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是驾驶员 不是坐办公室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are pilots, not a bunch of office workers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.93,0:29:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不要喊了 有话好好说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're shouting. There's no need to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.95,0:29:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那个挺厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这还有多久才关门大吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long until all this is shut down…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.15,0:29:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任科技 至少现在还不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust the tech. Not yet, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.33,0:29:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒觉得挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks pretty good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑客能入侵或者干扰远程系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remote systems can be hacked or compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上有关键的一票\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've got the key vote, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.11,0:30:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不就得了 决定权在你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there you go. It's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望我可以直接投赞成票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could just go ahead and approve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.38,0:30:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会里几乎一半的人都支持丽雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly half the council is backing Liwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.67,0:30:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会喜欢我的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't going to like my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎他们喜不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares what they like and what they don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.04,0:30:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说吧 我站在你这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, I'm gonna go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神上支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For moral support.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.82,0:30:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I want to get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你说出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you offered,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.39,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我已经请求让复仇流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I already requested Gipsy Avenger…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在委员会峰会上做荣誉护卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}as honor guard at the Council Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.24,0:30:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 复仇流浪者是奈特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know Gipsy's Nate's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的搭档投靠丽雯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His copilot works for Liwen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.21,0:30:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要一个新搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.55,0:30:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个据你了解可对接的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that you already know is drift compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.38,0:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你 我得支持你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.93,0:30:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你跟奈特说的时候 我也要在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to be there when you tell Nate,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想看看他有什么反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I just want to see his face. He's gonna be so pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.96,0:30:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会站在那 说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna stand there like,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲不适合你 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yeah, I don't think you belong in a Jaeger, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.41,0:30:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我的机甲里滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.58,0:30:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很帅 很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm handsome and sexy."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.05,0:30:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实很帅 很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is handsome. He is sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:30:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.01,0:31:12.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（澳大利亚 悉尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.38,0:31:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用一个阳光明媚的日子 迎来了新的周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of sunshine today to kick off our weekend. The city…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.40,0:31:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家下午好 我是彼得·欧文顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, everyone. Peter Overton…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.91,0:31:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在悉尼的第九点播室 为您播送新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}broadcasting from the Nine Studios in Sydney with the latest…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.70,0:31:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,据警方透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, police say…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前已经有49名警务人员在冲突中受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least 49 officers injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗议者头戴黑色面具 投掷瓶子和石块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju worshippers in black masks throwing bottles and rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,军防部队穿戴防暴装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}PPDC security in riot gear…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.58,0:31:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,严阵以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}are attempting to regain control…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇流浪者 我是权将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy Avenger, this is Marshal Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.48,0:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要威风凛凛的站在那就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is stand there and look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.52,0:31:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神集中点 尽量别摔倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay focused, try not to fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.29,0:31:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.32,0:31:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一 投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}In three, two, one. Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.99,0:32:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.53,0:32:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,同步对接出现紊乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drift alignment unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.40,0:32:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我找回感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.37,0:32:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.05,0:32:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,离子电池已经激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ion cells activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.68,0:32:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是彼此相通的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hey… We're in each other's heads, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.91,0:32:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不对朱尔斯想入非非 我会感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'd appreciate it if you'd stop thinking about Jules.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.81,0:32:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.46,0:32:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是也在想着要干掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you stop thinking about kicking my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.26,0:32:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这日子怎么熬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告将军 半球已校准
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.44,0:32:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经元连接较弱 但是在保持
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有外部通讯请求接入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.77,0:32:38.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（接触外部通讯 秘书长 森麻子）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.70,0:32:46.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无人机甲可行性报告）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.07,0:33:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.85,0:33:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者呼叫指挥中心 看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy to Command. You reading this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.84,0:33:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者 这里是指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, this is Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然出现不明机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, we have a rogue Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.33,0:33:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经注册机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilots of unregistered Jaeger,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.39,0:33:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上关闭电源 并离开你的驾驶舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}power down and exit your Conn-Pod immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.20,0:33:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 马上关闭电源 并离开驾驶舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat: power down and exit your Conn-Pods now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missiles fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.70,0:34:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.69,0:34:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动力不足警报 - 我们在失去动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Low power. Warning. - We're losing power!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.05,0:34:30.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（动力特征）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 不明机甲的动力参数和你的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! That Jaeger's power reading is the same…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在干扰我们的通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's jamming our comms!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.45,0:34:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.27,0:34:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.56,0:35:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.36,0:35:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.74,0:36:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻子中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.47,0:36:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在下坠 我们得救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going down! We've gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.87,0:36:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动引力弹弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating gravity sling!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.08,0:36:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.57,0:36:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是MMC052 我们中弹了 正在下坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mike, Mike, Charlie, zero, five, two! We have been hit and we are going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.19,0:36:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mako!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.81,0:37:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.38,0:38:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,同步对接失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drift alignment failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.12,0:38:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.32,0:38:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想想办法 - 同步对接失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do something… - Drift alignment failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个破脑子是不是傻掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid brain thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.07,0:39:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太擅长劝人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm not really good at emotional stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.53,0:39:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐的事 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am sorry about your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.34,0:39:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是同父异母什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.74,0:39:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她父母在恶魔女巫袭击时遇难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, her family died during the Onibaba attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.19,0:39:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲收养了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad took her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.19,0:39:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.69,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没穿制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you out of uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.27,0:39:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉尼那件事之后 我脑子里很乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had a lot on my mind after Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.51,0:39:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以想穿得舒服些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I just wanted to be comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.49,0:39:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别让兰伯特战士看见你穿这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't let Ranger Lambert see you in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.29,0:39:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他搞不好会掏出武器打你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might take the stick out of his butt and beat you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.69,0:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我还挺安全 它塞得紧紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm safe. It's wedged in there pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在使用莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're still using Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.44,0:39:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不知道为什么 就是对接不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And I can't drift with her for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他学员已经训练了好几年 而我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the other cadets have been training for years and I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.67,0:39:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌自己是个小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate feeling like the slow kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.26,0:39:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事不能勉强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.86,0:39:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你跟她进行对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're just grinding gears. I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.17,0:39:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.94,0:39:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.80,0:40:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.57,0:40:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神集中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.71,0:40:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好能一次成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to make a good connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.48,0:40:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱怨只会导致失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that if you're yappin' your gums.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.16,0:40:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.73,0:40:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.64,0:40:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 看看能不能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's see if we're drift compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.58,0:40:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.88,0:40:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经元负荷过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural load exceeding limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.01,0:40:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精神 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay focused, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.38,0:40:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记住 对接得越紧密 战斗力越强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, the stronger your connection, the better you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.42,0:40:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 跳过来 快 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! Come on, jump! Jump to me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.37,0:40:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须跳 阿玛拉 跳过来 跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to, Amara, come on! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.01,0:40:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 别纠缠过去的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! Don't hang on to the memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们快速闪过去 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it flow right through you. Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.25,0:40:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 快过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! Jump in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.30,0:40:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 快 靠近点 好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on. Get together. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二 茄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.72,0:41:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.09,0:41:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.52,0:41:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,晾一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.78,0:41:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 快让这段过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara. Amara, you need to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.26,0:41:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just listen to my voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.33,0:41:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.44,0:41:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿玛拉 - 爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amara! - Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.21,0:41:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 来 跳过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! Come on, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.65,0:41:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 我们要对接成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! We need to break the drift!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.48,0:41:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳过来别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump to me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.88,0:41:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.04,0:41:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我会抓住你的 我保证 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I will catch you, I promise. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.81,0:41:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 快跳过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.15,0:41:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.58,0:41:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.54,0:41:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快摘下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.50,0:42:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.05,0:42:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.66,0:42:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 是我 在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, it's me. You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.10,0:42:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来实验室 将军要见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me in the lab right away. Marshal wants to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.78,0:42:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.61,0:42:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.47,0:42:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.54,0:42:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻子发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.14,0:42:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她在直升机坠毁前发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was trying to send it from her copter right before it went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.35,0:42:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个高密度数据包\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a data package. High density.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.05,0:42:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇黑曜石发出干扰波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsidian Fury was jamming comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.09,0:42:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么发出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could her signal get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.56,0:42:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没成功 所以数据不完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't. At least not intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.56,0:42:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢失 在数码领域是相对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, "gone" is relative in the digital realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.00,0:43:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用改进后的分形算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}By running a modified fractal algorithm,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许能重新恢复几百万字节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be able to reconstruct a few megabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.03,0:43:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怪兽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a Kaiju?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.07,0:43:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在核对军防部队的怪兽档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm checking against PPDC Kaiju archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.91,0:43:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有匹配的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No match against the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.62,0:43:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续找 她一定认为这个文件非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking. Whatever this is, it was important to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.13,0:43:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.56,0:43:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想知道 操作那台不明机甲的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to know who was piloting that rogue Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.02,0:43:41.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邵氏工业 中国上海）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.24,0:43:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm, uh, I…I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你还在悉尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I thought you were still in Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.84,0:43:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会已经在紧急会议上批准使用无人机甲
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.26,0:44:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.19,0:44:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会更激动 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd be a little more enthusiastic, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.33,0:44:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我有点累 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I'm-I'm pumped. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.20,0:44:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这个时间点出现了袭击事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's just the timing of everything, with the attack and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.53,0:44:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,总觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}feels a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.04,0:44:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在现场 我知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there. I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.61,0:44:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果当时我们的无人机甲在
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.94,0:44:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉尼的悲剧 本可以避免
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.86,0:44:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经元对接程序终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural connection terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.78,0:44:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在所有人都看明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.50,0:44:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, I guess they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.79,0:44:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以纵观全局 袭击并不是一件坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.62,0:44:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你换个角度来看 可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look at it sideways and you squint, then maybe you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.10,0:44:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问 你这是在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm sorry, what are you…what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.17,0:44:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会要求我们四十八小时之内 完成全面部署
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.61,0:44:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十八小时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}48 is a…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.47,0:44:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我毕生的心血
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.15,0:44:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题 我去干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a problem. That-That'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.28,0:44:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十八小时
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.00,0:44:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得不可能是吗 那你就别干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You don't think there's a way? All right, well, then you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.37,0:44:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 现在行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.77,0:45:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准运气好 你还可以升个职什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you're promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.04,0:45:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧 给我完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We'll see how it goes. Just get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.55,0:45:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.87,0:45:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, honey! I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.83,0:45:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 回来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.21,0:45:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天那 事情实在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, things were…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.24,0:45:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 今天悉尼出了件大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}things were crazy today, with what happened in Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.22,0:45:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了不少人 现场的情形很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those people… it was, uh, not pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.55,0:45:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵老板也差点挂了 真死了就糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss almost got killed. That could've been bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.39,0:45:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 我猜 我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. I guess, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.74,0:45:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实没准她死了是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would've been great, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.34,0:45:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快喘不上气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one is all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.47,0:45:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在她的手下 一刻也不得消停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get a break from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.28,0:45:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在抱怨 不谈工作的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ranting. Enough about work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.28,0:45:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不说她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And enough about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.42,0:45:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该多关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}really, I should be focused on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.06,0:45:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们在卧室里好好亲热亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we have a little fun in the bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.53,0:46:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天过得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.67,0:46:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 是啊 那真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That's great. Yeah, that's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真让人激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.66,0:46:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.88,0:46:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给我提提神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little pick-me-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.17,0:46:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.49,0:46:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聊什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.43,0:46:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心思你都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.94,0:46:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of police officers…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.98,0:46:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫它复仇黑曜石\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're calling it Obsidian Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个完全陌生的机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never been a rogue like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.09,0:46:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,网上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}News feed said…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.76,0:46:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在纪念馆布置了十二台机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were posting a dozen Jaegers at the memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.13,0:46:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.73,0:46:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望也能有这么多机甲给我送行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that many to send me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.13,0:46:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你淘汰后 你老爸会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pop's gonna make you…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.41,0:46:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排跟乳房打交道的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}work with boobs when you wash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.21,0:46:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaegers do not…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.83,0:46:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲是不会送行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}show up when the boob guy dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.98,0:46:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸的工作跟乳房有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, your dad works with boobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.15,0:46:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个整形医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a plastic surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.35,0:46:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他的工作不只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't just work with…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.59,0:46:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会被淘汰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna wash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.09,0:46:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.12,0:46:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still. You die,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.10,0:46:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你寄个玩具机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}meh, I post one Jaeger at your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.70,0:46:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是半个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe half a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.17,0:46:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说阿玛拉被找到的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that's where they found Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.14,0:46:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在半个机甲里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In half a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.48,0:47:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是完整的机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a whole Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.88,0:47:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个头不大而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just wasn't very big,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viktoriya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.26,0:47:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不大就是废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.54,0:47:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.81,0:47:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.41,0:47:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.02,0:47:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I saying that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.98,0:47:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.66,0:47:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.15,0:47:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我历经千辛万苦才到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked every day of my life to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.03,0:47:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.99,0:47:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个从大街上捡来的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just picked up off the street like garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.74,0:47:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.22,0:47:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我在哪儿学的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where I learned that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.62,0:47:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大街上 没教养的丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the streets, you big, dumb…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.62,0:47:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ranger on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.50,0:47:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她先动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She jumped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.47,0:47:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't belong here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.54,0:47:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.21,0:47:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.21,0:47:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚来的时候跟你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I first joined the Corps, I was just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.08,0:47:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.42,0:47:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.26,0:48:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是今天下葬的那位女士森麻子说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that woman we laid to rest today, Mako Mori,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.07,0:48:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 无论是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}she said, "Whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.80,0:48:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为学员的那天起就是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the minute you enter this program, you join a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.11,0:48:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他们做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And no matter what they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.02,0:48:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他们有时候做的事多么愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how stupid they may act sometimes…"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.29,0:48:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅他们 别放在心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…you forgive 'em and you move on".
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.37,0:48:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有开始相信这些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you start believing that. In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.98,0:48:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,操作机甲的时候 你们才能信任彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll start believing in a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.85,0:48:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军在找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal's looking for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.56,0:48:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布有新发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says Gottlieb found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.23,0:48:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是怪兽 而是一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't something. It's somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.80,0:48:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,北地群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Severnaya Zemlya.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.74,0:48:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西伯利亚泰梅尔半岛以北\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off Siberia's Taymyr Peninsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.85,0:48:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in Zemlya?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.05,0:48:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.82,0:48:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争初期\N{\fnArial\fs30}A facility roughly in this location…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.99,0:48:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经利用那个地方的一处设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}was used to manufacture Jaeger power…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.82,0:48:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,生产过机甲的能量内核\N{\fnArial\fs30}cores earlier in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.05,0:48:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是几年前已经废弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was decommissioned years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.57,0:48:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么麻子要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Mako be trying to tell us…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.10,0:48:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个已经废弃已久的工厂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}about an abandoned factory in the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.72,0:48:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,请准许我们驾驶复仇流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, permission to take Gipsy Avenger…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.45,0:48:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看那里到底有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see what the hell's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:04.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西伯利亚 北地群岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.91,0:49:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来麻子的信息有误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Mako's message was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个废弃的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.49,0:49:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.67,0:49:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些奇怪的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting some weird readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.11,0:49:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.30,0:50:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击它的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out his legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.55,0:50:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.22,0:51:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等离子炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.27,0:51:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好像把它惹火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we pissed him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.38,0:51:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.79,0:51:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得以前的招数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember our old move?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.53,0:51:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.32,0:51:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.59,0:51:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击它的动力内核\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for his power core!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.42,0:52:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.43,0:52:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇黑曜石的驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilots of Obsidian Fury,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.63,0:52:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从驾驶舱里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get the hell out of your Conn-Pod!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.89,0:52:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.88,0:53:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's definitely Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.25,0:53:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有控制后肢的次级大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secondary brain used to control the hindquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.35,0:53:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是怎么来到我们的世界的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they get into our world?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫洞已经十年没出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There hasn't been a breach in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.39,0:53:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然探测器一定会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensors would've picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.26,0:53:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为有虫洞出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think there was a breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.20,0:53:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽身上有明显的未知世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju flesh has a distinct radioactive half-life signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.76,0:53:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射性半衰期特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particular to the Anteverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.60,0:53:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家伙身上没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This specimen does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.76,0:53:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说它来自我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so, you're-you're saying that it's from our universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.06,0:53:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因指纹清楚的表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The genetic fingerprints indicate distinctly…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.39,0:53:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是地球生物改造技术的产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrestrial modification techniques, probably engineered…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.75,0:53:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是用战后遗留的怪兽肉体改造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Kaiju flesh left over from the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.40,0:53:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是先驱干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precursors didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.78,0:53:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans did.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.79,0:53:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 那团粘呼呼的烂肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. That hunk of slimy crap…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.50,0:53:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然能控制复仇黑曜石\N{\fnArial\fs30}was piloting Obsidian Fury?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.24,0:53:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该到里面看一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get a look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.87,0:53:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意是怪兽的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing's part Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.76,0:53:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.91,0:53:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果现在不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are we ever gonna get a chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.51,0:53:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后就没有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see something like this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.95,0:53:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.79,0:54:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有才好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.15,0:54:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不去就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.23,0:54:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己去 - 不 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going. - No, Amar…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.00,0:54:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, we should not be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.95,0:54:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个程序都是融合过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fused all the way through the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.26,0:54:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是肌肉组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like… muscle tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.87,0:54:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它行动才那么自如 酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it was able to move like it did. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.16,0:54:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.42,0:54:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是和乳房打交道比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with boobs is sounding better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.26,0:54:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,照这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shine your light over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.23,0:54:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要抓住那个怪兽就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, let's just go yank on the guts of the weird-ass Kaiju killbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.21,0:54:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's some sort of…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,津海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinhai!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.15,0:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了别去拉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to yank on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.06,0:54:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去叫人 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get help! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.26,0:54:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下全完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we are so screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.10,0:54:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个处罚对她太严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes way past what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.77,0:54:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下是你的事 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security will take it from here. We're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.04,0:55:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,津海没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Jinhai okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.86,0:55:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,会留疤 但他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got some scarring, but yeah, he'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.86,0:55:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军给他记察看处分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshal put him on probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.70,0:55:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,美琳和苏雷什也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meilin and Suresh, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.07,0:55:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再犯错 全都走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They blink wrong, all of 'em are out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不怪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.34,0:55:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉他们去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked them into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.18,0:55:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我跟将军争取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I tried to talk to the marshal, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.91,0:55:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你被项目开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're dismissed from the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.15,0:55:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我也不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never belonged here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.49,0:55:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.00,0:55:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前我也说过这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to say the same thing a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.11,0:55:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是真的不想待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I actually didn't want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.58,0:55:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.22,0:55:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you sign up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.99,0:55:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时在打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.56,0:55:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲是机甲部队长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my dad was leading the charge…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.99,0:55:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在这里 也许能更多了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought… maybe I could see more of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.87,0:55:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至能和他对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even drift with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.24,0:55:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有天晚上 我和奈特溜进了机甲库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one night, me and Nate got into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.00,0:55:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了太多蠢事 我都记不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over something stupid. I can't even remember what.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.14,0:55:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钻进了老四代机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I climbed in an old Mark 4…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.01,0:55:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想让他看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to show him…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.75,0:56:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没他 我照样能成为优秀的驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need him to be a great pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.82,0:56:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实够傻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.79,0:56:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.74,0:56:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走了多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far'd you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.19,0:56:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概七步吧 信不信由你\N{\fnArial\fs30}About seven steps, well, take or leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.16,0:56:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是几步\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.30,0:56:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,才两步 我就晕过去了 压力太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}About two steps, then I blacked out from the strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.41,0:56:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒来时第一眼就看到父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the first thing I saw when I woke up was my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.08,0:56:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在我面前 脸拉得老长\N{\fnArial\fs30}just standing right in front of me, looking stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.65,0:56:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh-What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.75,0:56:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我被项目开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I was out of the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.49,0:56:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我不配做机甲战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I didn't deserve to be in a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.39,0:56:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 他说了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he said a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.87,0:56:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年后 我父亲牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year later, my dad was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.44,0:56:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再没机会证明他是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't get a chance to prove him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.05,0:56:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.38,0:56:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我证明自己的机会也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a chance to prove it to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.48,0:56:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.06,0:56:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用别人的话评价自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let what other people think of you define who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.57,0:56:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢那样的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't like where that takes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.70,0:56:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.62,0:56:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep your head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.12,0:56:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you might just be…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该像我这样摆一副酷脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}as good-looking as me in this type of situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.19,0:56:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.60,0:57:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张脸长得很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}This face is, is set up well.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.17,0:57:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,美也是一种负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty is a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.31,0:57:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.76,0:57:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵氏工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shao Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.40,0:57:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.30,0:57:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇黑曜石上有邵氏工业的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsidian Fury has tech in it made by Shao Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.64,0:57:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.18,0:57:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱尔斯和她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jules and her team…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.97,0:57:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个机甲扫描了好几遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}scanned every centimeter of that Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.48,0:57:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,并联电缆里的绝缘超材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insulating metamaterials wound counterclockwise…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.98,0:57:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是逆时针缠绕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the shunt cabling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.73,0:57:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有邵氏工业也会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shao's the only company that winds them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.90,0:57:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿玛拉 你肯定吗 - 我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amara, are you sure about what you're telling me right now? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.84,0:57:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造拳击手时 偷了很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole a ton to make Scrapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.95,0:57:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这可能是重要的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it might be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.79,0:57:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.33,0:57:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵氏工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shao Industries?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.10,0:57:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们连生物部门都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't even have a bio division.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.11,0:57:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们所知 确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not that we know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.56,0:57:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,电缆可能是偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cabling could have been stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像阿玛拉机甲里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like in Amara's Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.08,0:57:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把黑曜石和邵氏联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more than that…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.32,0:57:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}to connect Fury to Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.52,0:58:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问纽特怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Newt?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.72,0:58:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能访问内部资料 运输单据\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have access to the internal records, the shipping manifests…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.33,0:58:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.50,0:58:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任务给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.74,0:58:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.86,0:58:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去向将军汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take what we know to the marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.14,0:58:15.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邵氏工业）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.79,0:58:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵总 大楼一切安全
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.16,0:58:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有相关证件 任何人不许入内
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.67,0:58:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望部署受到任何威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.63,0:58:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.22,0:58:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在我办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.80,0:58:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.64,0:58:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.85,0:58:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.22,0:58:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个处罚有点过重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.00,0:58:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我犯的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.30,0:58:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承担后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.15,0:59:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.50,0:59:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你再造机甲时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next Jaeger you build…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.00,0:59:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,造一个大点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}make it a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.46,0:59:29.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣地亚哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.20,0:59:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}System online.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.43,0:59:30.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.93,0:59:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经百分之百交货了 各位 - 程序在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we have delivery at 100%, people. - System online.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.94,0:59:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之百 这才叫干得漂亮 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred percent! That's the way that it's done, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.24,0:59:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们说过 我们能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we could do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.45,0:59:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.78,0:59:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,与无人机甲375的无线通讯连接突然中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing uplink to drone 375!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.16,0:59:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 发生故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.87,0:59:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 快弄清楚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Figure out why!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.07,0:59:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把知道的一切 当面告知委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take what we know to the council in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.57,0:59:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep a transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.85,0:59:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.08,0:59:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的无人机甲出现了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.52,0:59:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须立即停止派遣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.85,1:00:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入流浪者 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to Gipsy! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.73,1:00:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有驾驶员 驾驶机甲与敌方开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}All pilots, man your Jaegers and engage hostiles!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.26,1:00:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you got this. You cool?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.58,1:00:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 超好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, super cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.51,1:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.72,1:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯乐博士 邵总在找你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.15,1:00:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我正要过去 我这就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I know. I'm heading up! I'm heading right…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.09,1:00:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.56,1:00:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这儿 你怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you doing here? How'd you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.86,1:00:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有军防部队的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do have PPDC credentials,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.28,1:00:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说现在大家似乎都把心思放在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and besides, everyone else seems a little bit preoccupied…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.37,1:00:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们老板刚刚部署的夺命无人机甲上\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the killer drones your boss just set off!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.82,1:01:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她利用了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.72,1:01:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.30,1:01:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她用金钱收买你 虚名诱惑你 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She lured you with money and a fancy title. - No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.81,1:01:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你被成功冲昏头脑的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while you were basking in the glow,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.64,1:01:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就拿走你的研究成果 为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}she took your research and she twisted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我阻止她 纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me stop her, Newton.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.35,1:01:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拯救世界 就像上次那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me save the world like old times.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.10,1:01:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 严格来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, technically, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.16,1:01:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次其实是你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were helping me last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get that straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.50,1:01:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.57,1:01:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来帮我 其实也是帮你自己拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me help you save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.00,1:01:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.91,1:01:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.22,1:01:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say… Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.84,1:01:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…别 别开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.55,1:01:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 为什么我的中文讲得这么烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Why can't I get this language?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.56,1:01:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.23,1:01:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 那是机甲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara! Are those Jaegers?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.93,1:02:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是邵氏工业的无人机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're drones from Shao Industries.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.47,1:02:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.30,1:02:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 它们发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. They just went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.58,1:02:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Clear the deck now!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.74,1:02:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻回你们的宿舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to your quarters right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.59,1:02:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.76,1:02:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 赶紧离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get the hell out of here! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.10,1:02:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.74,1:02:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.57,1:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.43,1:02:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hermann!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.61,1:02:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little help!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.68,1:02:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你能不能学学开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, why don't you learn how to use a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.62,1:02:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.69,1:03:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋 你们这些坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vile, vile individual!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.83,1:03:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Newton.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.66,1:03:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是因为我不习惯在别人面前做亲密动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hug you if I didn't have a rule about…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.67,1:03:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想抱抱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}public displays of affection.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.40,1:03:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.00,1:03:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, to hell with it. - Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.51,1:03:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抱够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're done groping me,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.61,1:03:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快去对付无人机甲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's take care of the drones, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.70,1:03:13.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（错误）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.41,1:03:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭所有程序 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.70,1:03:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 离开实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, get out of the lab…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.18,1:03:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.52,1:03:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一人给2000\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot you twice!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.14,1:03:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会发疯的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.89,1:03:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被开除了 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're officially fired. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.25,1:03:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.92,1:03:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做才能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.70,1:03:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有后门 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a back door, Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.84,1:03:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,后门在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.54,1:03:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设计的子程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the drone subroutine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.64,1:03:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在子主程序里安装了后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I added a subroutine…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,以备将来我可以随时进来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case I want to get in here and poke around down the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.68,1:03:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狡猾的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sneaky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.09,1:03:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.85,1:03:38.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 错误）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.23,1:03:40.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统信息 已确认 启动虫洞协议）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.47,1:03:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.44,1:03:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经计划了十年的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I've been planning the last ten years.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.08,1:03:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要终结这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ending the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.03,1:03:54.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国 火奴鲁鲁）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.54,1:04:02.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏威夷 火奴鲁鲁 探测到虫洞）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:04.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中国 香港 探测到虫洞）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.95,1:04:09.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿拉斯加 安克雷奇 探测到虫洞）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.39,1:04:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的驾驶员都在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.06,1:04:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告近况
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.10,1:04:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,多地出现裂缝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.06,1:04:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些无人机甲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.49,1:04:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体驾驶员 探测到虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All pilots, breaches detected.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.20,1:04:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人机甲正在打开虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drones in the field are opening multiple breaches…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.17,1:04:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,环太平洋多个地区告急\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the Pacific Rim.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.84,1:04:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do this? Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.64,1:04:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.38,1:04:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.58,1:04:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说不会 我并不是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not normally, not really my style.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.35,1:04:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.13,1:04:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是恨你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I hate you all…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.06,1:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不把我当回事 像对待小丑一样对待我\N{\fnArial\fs30}for treating me like an insignificant little joke of a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.33,1:05:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是我这么做的原因 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why he did it, Hermann…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.80,1:05:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.57,1:05:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, see.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.41,1:05:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.14,1:05:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.78,1:05:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近好像完全感觉不到自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not feeling totally myself these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.82,1:05:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.91,1:05:18.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怪兽大脑标本）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.40,1:05:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是先驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precursors.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.78,1:05:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 赫尔曼 你懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Hermann, you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.95,1:05:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前一样 又比别人慢半拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as usual, a step behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.55,1:05:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newton.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.49,1:05:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.56,1:05:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh, Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.50,1:05:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须阻止它 - 不 反击它们没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must stop. - No, there's no point in fighting them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.45,1:05:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须反击 - 我没那么强 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must fight back. - I'm not strong enough, Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.04,1:05:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 纽曼 你必须 - 我没那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, Newton. You must! - I am not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.01,1:05:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都没那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you are strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.83,1:05:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 赫尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.89,1:05:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经控制了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.45,1:05:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.37,1:06:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想毁了这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.11,1:06:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.91,1:06:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.91,1:06:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你们回宿舍去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to get to quarters!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.35,1:06:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the doors are blocked!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.39,1:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.97,1:06:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么背着我做的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.29,1:06:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道你公司百分之三十八的东西都是自动化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, 38% of your company is fully automated.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在这里动个手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really wasn't very hard…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.07,1:06:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里动个手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reallocate a little over here,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.14,1:06:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没什么难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a little over there,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.28,1:06:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你不注意的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slip in a little Kaiju surprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.45,1:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就偷偷送你个小怪兽惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}without you noticing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.74,1:06:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你总认为…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.33,1:06:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这最聪明的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.54,1:06:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.20,1:06:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.94,1:06:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特不能控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newt's not in control of himself!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.91,1:06:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他 是先驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't him! It's the Precursors.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.75,1:06:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是因为他和怪兽对接的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have infected his mind…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.35,1:06:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被感染了大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we drifted with the Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.01,1:06:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保 抓住葛斯乐博士
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.76,1:06:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是反抗 就地枪毙
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.39,1:06:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.60,1:07:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去试试接近流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna try and get to Gipsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.60,1:07:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.51,1:07:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.11,1:07:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 数到三就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. On three.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.51,1:07:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.14,1:07:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.85,1:07:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.89,1:07:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.99,1:07:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.73,1:07:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇到袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.76,1:07:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶紧让丽雯关掉无人机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to force Liwen to shut down the drones!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.50,1:07:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她 不是丽雯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't her. It isn't Liwen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.47,1:07:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It-it was Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.67,1:07:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被先驱感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Precursors, they've infected him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.64,1:07:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们控制了他的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're controlling his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.41,1:07:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.05,1:07:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让他关掉无人机甲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you get him to disable the drones?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.65,1:07:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 他已经跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.13,1:07:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布 关掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, shut 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.67,1:07:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经进入主程序
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.86,1:07:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是想把你锁在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It-It's trying to lock you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.01,1:07:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,反馈回路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feedback loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.43,1:07:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布 到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.23,1:07:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.58,1:08:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布 关掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, shut 'em down…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.16,1:08:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.76,1:08:19.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（反馈手雷完成 上传）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.18,1:08:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.88,1:08:57.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（虫洞）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.93,1:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽雯关掉了无人机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liwen has disabled the drones.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.31,1:09:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫洞被关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breaches are closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.42,1:09:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 虫洞被关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, the breaches are closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.59,1:09:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.06,1:09:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, no" what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.23,1:09:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三只怪兽已经爬出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three Kaiju have gotten through.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.64,1:09:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,分别在韩国 俄罗斯海岸和中国东海\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Korea, Russian coast, and East China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.84,1:09:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个四代 一个五代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Cat 4s and a Cat 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.81,1:09:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.45,1:09:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to the dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.78,1:09:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要所有的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.96,1:09:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You girls okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.83,1:09:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.78,1:09:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.55,1:09:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍在接收报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reports are still coming in,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.65,1:09:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过无人机甲干掉了机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but drones took out Jaegers…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.89,1:09:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和环太平洋的机甲基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Shatterdomes across the Rim.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们这里有多少机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How many Jaegers do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.63,1:09:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可操作的 就只有复仇流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operational? Gipsy Avenger, barely.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.43,1:09:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.00,1:09:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.76,1:09:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们需要更多的机甲投入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We need more Jaegers up and running…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.34,1:09:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然很快就会被灭掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or this is gonna be a short fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.60,1:09:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们办得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we can,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.34,1:09:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们所有的驾驶员非死即重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of our other pilots are either dead or severely injured.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.43,1:09:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一次解决一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, one disaster at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.85,1:09:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先处理机甲的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just focus on those Jaegers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:09:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smallie, come over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.83,1:10:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮朱尔斯维修机甲行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help Jules with the repairs. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.70,1:10:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.11,1:10:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在准你归队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kicking you back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.15,1:10:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能把破铜烂铁变成机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's pretty good at turning junk into Jaegers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.15,1:10:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.09,1:10:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.92,1:10:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们任务很重 时间却不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we got a lot of work to do and not a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.03,1:10:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西飞来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.69,1:10:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought some help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.53,1:10:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,白蛇 伯劳刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuja, Shrikethorn,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.74,1:10:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有大家伙 雷怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the big fella, Raijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.84,1:11:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随意给它们起了这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the liberty of assigning the designations.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.25,1:11:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 带刺的和傻大个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the spiky guy and the big idiot…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.12,1:11:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在离开城市 并向大海前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}are moving away from the cities and towards the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.46,1:11:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.76,1:11:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它们是想在中国东海和白蛇会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're trying to link up with Hakuja in the East China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.33,1:11:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我猜纽特知道它们想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet Newt would know what they're up to,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.00,1:11:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过得先问出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can get it out of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.27,1:11:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们得先找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'd have to find him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.52,1:11:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有离这些怪兽更近的机甲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any Jaegers closer to those Kaiju than us?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.52,1:11:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,秦都和萨林克基地幸存的机甲在尽力拦截\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was left of the Chin-do and the Sakhalinsk domes tried to intercept…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.99,1:11:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 是尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}emphasis on "tried."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.23,1:11:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们得靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.53,1:11:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.60,1:11:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么东西在东海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in the East China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.77,1:11:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它们要去的不是东海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's not where they're headed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.51,1:11:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把怪兽在战争中移动的地图展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up a map of Kaiju movement from the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.98,1:11:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把数据放到主屏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pushing data to main display.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.66,1:11:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你还知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you know something we don't?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.53,1:11:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 我们得明白敌人的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we need to understand our enemy's objective…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.53,1:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道是否已经打败了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know we've beaten them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.50,1:11:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一怪兽并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the Kaiju weren't…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲目的攻击我们的城市呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}blindly attacking our cities during the war?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.04,1:11:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们是正好挡路了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we were just in their way?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.68,1:11:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.79,1:11:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本的富士山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount Fuji, Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.56,1:12:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,推测下白蛇 伯劳刺和雷怪的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extrapolate for Hakuja, Shrikethorn and Raijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.61,1:12:04.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（富士山）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.81,1:12:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,富士山 可为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount Fuji? But why?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.11,1:12:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了稀有元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rare earth elements.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.12,1:12:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,富士山是一座含有大量稀有元素的火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount Fuji is a volcano rich in rare earth elements.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.03,1:12:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽的血液可以与之产生剧烈的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaiju blood reacts extremely violently with rare earth elements…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.33,1:12:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的燃料推进器试验正是以此为基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the basis of my fuel-thruster experiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.24,1:12:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.12,1:12:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着不妙 不太妙 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that sounds bad. That's bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.31,1:12:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.21,1:12:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,富士山是活火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount Fuji's active,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.45,1:12:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个地质压力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}a geological pressure point.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.98,1:12:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据怪兽血液可达到的质量比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the blood-to-mass ratio of the Kaiju,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.18,1:12:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个反应会引起喷发事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reaction would cause a cascade event,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.03,1:12:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃环太平洋的火圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}igniting the Ring of Fire around the Pacific Rim.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.10,1:12:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,数十亿吨的有毒气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billions of tons of toxic gas…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.44,1:12:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和灰烬会喷到大气层之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ash will spew into the atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.25,1:12:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭绝地球上一切生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}wiping out all life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.02,1:12:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后帮先驱达成改造地球的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finish terraforming the Earth for the Precursors.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.56,1:12:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让它们抵达富士山\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let 'em reach Mount Fuji.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.63,1:12:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问朱尔斯机甲的维修进度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna check with Jules for Jaeger repairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.13,1:12:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们有一百架机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we had a hundred Jaegers,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.14,1:12:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可时间不等人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no way to intercept in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.44,1:12:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的推进器能用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your thruster pods?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.84,1:12:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.58,1:12:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not, they're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.15,1:12:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can they be?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.95,1:13:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上 如果 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in theory, if it, um… maybe,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.49,1:13:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的帮助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}with-with your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布 理论上是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, what does that mean, "in theory"?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.47,1:13:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是今天能行的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today… it means yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.98,1:13:31.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手臂安装中）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.83,1:14:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜 英勇保护者和凤凰游击士 可以出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber Athena, Guardian Bravo, and Bracer Phoenix are good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.77,1:14:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不太够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a lot to work with.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.07,1:14:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把黑曜石技术用在流浪者身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Liwen can patch some Fury tech into Gipsy,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.71,1:14:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might help.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.08,1:14:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 全力以赴做好部署工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Prep everything we got for deployment.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.85,1:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你要活着回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.36,1:14:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.30,1:14:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's confusing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.12,1:14:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别分心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.99,1:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有四架机甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got four Jaegers…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对手是两个四代和一个五代\N{\fnArial\fs30}against two Category 4s and a Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.08,1:14:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比只有一架流浪者强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than just Gipsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.73,1:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still need pilots.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.85,1:14:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.48,1:14:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.51,1:14:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我父亲在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my dad was here,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.42,1:14:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许会高谈阔论一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd probably give you a big speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.88,1:14:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们觉得战无不胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make you feel invincible.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.53,1:15:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.40,1:15:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一个英雄 我跟他不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hero like he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.90,1:15:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟罗利 贝克特以及森麻子都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Raleigh Becket and Mako Mori.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.69,1:15:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们也不是一开始就是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they didn't start out that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.66,1:15:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是人 学员做起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started out as cadets,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.36,1:15:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.53,1:15:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一想起他们就觉得是巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We remember them as giants…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.93,1:15:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他们形象高大\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they stood tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.54,1:15:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they stood together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.46,1:15:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的父母是谁不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter who your parents are,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.92,1:15:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,背景不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you came from,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.05,1:15:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们是否相信你们也不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}who believed in you and who didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.52,1:15:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是 我们现在是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are a family now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.43,1:15:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地球最后的防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are Earth's last defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.66,1:15:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是属于我们的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our time,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.30,1:15:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有机会去改变这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our chance to make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.02,1:15:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们打起精神 一起干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's mount up and get it done!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.68,1:15:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.88,1:15:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.18,1:15:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaeger pilots,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.45,1:15:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.64,1:15:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.59,1:15:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.78,1:15:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.14,1:15:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟我一起拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now help me save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.70,1:15:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.20,1:16:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,程序在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}System online.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.48,1:16:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating neural handshake.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.45,1:16:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Establishing neural link.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.36,1:16:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, jump in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.73,1:16:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经元对接很强 很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural handshake strong and steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.34,1:16:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在真正的机甲里感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…how does it feel to be in a real Jaeger?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.48,1:16:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对接感觉还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.48,1:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 全体机甲报数 可否发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all Jaegers sound off. Go-no-go for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.98,1:16:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,英勇保护者 可以发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian Bravo, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.08,1:16:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜 可以发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber Athena, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.50,1:16:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰游击士 早就该发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracer Phoenix, let's go already.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.26,1:16:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.61,1:16:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.61,1:16:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are go for launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.84,1:16:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 复仇流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Gipsy Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.82,1:16:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒后点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignition in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.40,1:16:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.76,1:16:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.23,1:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.60,1:16:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnArial\fs30}six,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.64,1:16:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}five,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.01,1:16:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}four,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.36,1:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}three,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.88,1:16:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}two,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.24,1:16:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.40,1:16:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignition!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.16,1:17:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 超出结构承载极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Exceeding structural limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.75,1:17:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.44,1:17:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奶奶以前经常给我放这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother used to play it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.66,1:17:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps me calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.81,1:17:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.95,1:17:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不冷静 哥们儿 我冷静不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not calm, man, not calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.13,1:17:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it would work.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.21,1:18:01.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（日本 东京）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.96,1:18:38.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警报 怪兽来袭）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.67,1:19:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者呼叫指挥中心 已找到目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy to Command. Targets acquired.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.64,1:19:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Gipsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.64,1:19:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市里的人都在地下防空洞 他们很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in the city is secured in underground shelters.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.14,1:19:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以执行任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are clear to engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.65,1:19:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到指令 等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid copy. Going hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.42,1:19:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰游击士跟着我 我们干掉雷怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracer Phoenix, on me. We'll take Raijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.42,1:19:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Gipsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.42,1:19:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜 英勇保护者 你们干掉另外两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber Athena, Guardian Bravo, you take the other two…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.65,1:19:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.53,1:19:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我们来拯救世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our turn to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.30,1:19:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.14,1:19:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.99,1:19:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one, mark!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.36,1:20:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.47,1:20:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者 雷怪的面板能吸收攻击的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy, Raijin's faceplates are absorbing the hits…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.38,1:20:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再反过来攻击你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throwing the energy back at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.61,1:20:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看它怎么吸收这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see it absorb this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.78,1:21:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙能扛多少栋楼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many buildings can this thing take?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.86,1:21:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯劳刺来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shrikethorn inbound!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.31,1:21:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们需要支援 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, we could use a little help over here! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.95,1:21:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 军刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Saber.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.97,1:21:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,维柯 干掉伯劳刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vik, take out Shrikethorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.29,1:21:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在干\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.55,1:21:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜 英勇保护者来支援了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber Athena, Guardian Bravo coming to assist!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.04,1:21:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动电弧鞭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating arc whip!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.69,1:22:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 你赶紧跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right! You better run!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.83,1:22:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西不难对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things ain't that tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.86,1:22:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰游击士 注意你六点钟方向 敌方抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracer Phoenix, watch your six! Hostile inbound!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.16,1:22:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.84,1:22:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 又是巨型机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're going with giant robots again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.88,1:22:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 真有创意 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, real original, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.38,1:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不惊讶 一点都不惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not impressed. I'm not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.32,1:23:06.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邵氏工业）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.74,1:23:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静 东南方三千米 出现大量敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got movement! Multiple hostiles, three kilometers southeast.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.55,1:23:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽雯 你在看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liwen! Are you reading this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.25,1:23:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的一个自动化工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of my automated factories.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.33,1:23:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纽特 他在东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Newt. He's in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.53,1:23:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在找出他的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locating his position.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.63,1:23:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是敌方 他们正快速靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostiles, one klick away and closing fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.10,1:23:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体机甲 准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Jaegers, brace for contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.88,1:23:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengage and brace for contact!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.67,1:23:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.65,1:23:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, all right. Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.36,1:23:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲 上吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, baby, go, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.08,1:23:48.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（改变撕裂虫路线）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.56,1:23:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they going?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.34,1:24:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大一只啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.99,1:25:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体机甲前进 把所有火力都用上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Jaegers, advance and fire everything you've got…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.87,1:25:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my command!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.83,1:25:35.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（军防部队保卫我们的未来）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.44,1:25:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,保卫者 快退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian, stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.87,1:25:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回来 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative! That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.02,1:25:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些可恶的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freaking teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.42,1:25:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which ones?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.29,1:25:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都打\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.18,1:26:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊利亚 苏雷什 回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilya, Suresh, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.46,1:26:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到没有 你们俩 回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy? Come on, guys, sound off!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.66,1:26:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,英勇保护者 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian Bravo, give me a sitrep.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.93,1:26:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.99,1:26:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护者倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian's down.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.94,1:26:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在驾驶室出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pinned in the Conn-Pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.58,1:26:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏雷什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.22,1:26:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏雷什 他没撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suresh didn't make it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.13,1:26:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.10,1:26:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那里别动 我们尽快派人过去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just stay put, and we'll send you help as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.06,1:26:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰游击士 报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracer Phoenix, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.59,1:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.00,1:26:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞坏了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a little banged up,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.49,1:26:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还能战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're still in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.50,1:27:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是 军刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us, too, Saber.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.87,1:27:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说军刀雅典娜 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Saber Athena, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.24,1:27:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀 凤凰游击士 准备在下列坐标进行拦截\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saber, Bracer, prepare to intercept at the following coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.48,1:27:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来干掉它们 - 动起来 别迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's finish this. - Move your ass, and don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.34,1:27:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 凤凰游击士 快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Bracer Phoenix hauling ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.26,1:27:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者呼叫指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy to Command,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.66,1:27:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有敌人的战略扫描图吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have a tactical scan of the hostile?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.36,1:27:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在评估传感器连接的数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assessing data from their sensors.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.27,1:27:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了 流浪者 但仍在处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have it, Gipsy, but it's still compiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.14,1:27:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 能定位大脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time. Can you locate the brains?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.29,1:27:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的中央大脑有防护甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostile's central brain mass is heavily armored.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.42,1:27:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的武器无法穿透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your weapons won't be able to penetrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.68,1:27:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次级大脑呢 这个怪物有次级大脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a secondary brain? This son of a bitch have one of those?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.79,1:27:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怪兽有三个次级大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostile has three secondary brains,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个组成部分配备一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}one for each component Kaiju.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.77,1:27:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告正在发送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.01,1:27:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,军刀雅典娜 确认收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Package confirmed for Saber Athena!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.55,1:27:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰游击士收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed for Bracer Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.69,1:27:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家跟着我 保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, team, follow my lead and stay alert!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.71,1:27:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动丽雯给我们准备的黑曜石技术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire up some of that Fury tech Liwen grabbed us?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.16,1:27:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read my mind, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.78,1:28:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 受损评估 - 弹出 弹出 弹出\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damage detected. - Eject! Eject! Eject!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.13,1:28:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶员 弹出\N{\fnArial\fs30}All pilots, eject!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.20,1:29:37.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿纳海姆电子公司）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.31,1:29:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.54,1:30:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 神经元负荷过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Neural load exceeding limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.10,1:30:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate! Nate!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.34,1:30:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈特 保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate! Stay with me! Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.51,1:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! Nate!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.01,1:30:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶员倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.66,1:30:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒是站起来啊 你这一堆烂铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up from that, you pile of junk!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.32,1:31:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.75,1:31:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽雯 你能支援一下他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liwen! Is there anything you can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.92,1:31:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要更多的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more time!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.06,1:31:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have any!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.10,1:31:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果怪兽抵达富士山\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the hostile reaches Mount Fuji…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.53,1:31:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.50,1:31:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它休想到山顶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.78,1:31:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 没有搭档 你不能驾驶流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, you can't operate Gipsy without a copilot!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.59,1:31:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力会让你神经崩裂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strain will tear your mind apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.13,1:31:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.87,1:31:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和其他人重组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regroup with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.20,1:31:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.42,1:31:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy Avenger,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.42,1:31:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿玛拉·纳玛尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Amara Namani!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.08,1:31:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来支援你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by for assist.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.12,1:31:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 不要 你跳不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, don't. You won't make it…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.56,1:31:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.19,1:31:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.87,1:32:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.22,1:32:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候听过话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do I listen?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.58,1:32:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 该你上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.12,1:32:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.09,1:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们俩让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting the hell out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.29,1:32:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.49,1:32:17.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弹射）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.22,1:32:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹出程序启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ejection sequence initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.35,1:32:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹出程序成功执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ejection sequence successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.17,1:32:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吗小不点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for this, smallie?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.35,1:32:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.27,1:32:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.92,1:32:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,待命 指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, Command.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.80,1:32:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动神经元对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating neural handshake.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.40,1:32:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经元正在对接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Establishing neural link.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.11,1:32:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.94,1:32:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,本想做个拉风的动作 这下可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was supposed to be epic, but it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.41,1:33:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不拉风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.25,1:33:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 级联故障 多个程序离线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Cascade failure. Multiple systems offline.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.01,1:33:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reboot!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.54,1:33:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 重启中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.53,1:33:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command to Gipsy. Hostile is…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.43,1:33:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽距离富士山山顶还有两公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}two kilometers from the summit of Mount Fuji…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.60,1:33:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在快速靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}and closing fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.93,1:33:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特里布 推进器里剩下的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gottlieb, do you have enough fuel left in your thrusters…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.48,1:33:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把我们送到大气层吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to launch us into the atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.14,1:33:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.21,1:33:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.71,1:33:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该能 但你们下来时就减不了速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly, but there won't be enough to slow your reentry…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.08,1:33:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.79,1:33:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把流浪者砸到怪兽身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna drop Gipsy right on top of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.46,1:33:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的逃生舱已经弹出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just ejected my escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.33,1:33:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我们两个都用我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We'll have to use mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.83,1:33:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 只有一个推进器有足够的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, there's only one thruster with enough fuel remaining.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.60,1:33:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把位置发给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending location.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.87,1:33:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 查看中\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, checking.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.68,1:33:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too far away.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.59,1:33:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这方法行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.91,1:33:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇流浪者 数据已经入站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy Avenger! Transport inbound!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.12,1:33:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,远程程序在线 等待支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remote systems are online. Sending help!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.86,1:34:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.71,1:34:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已到达推进器位置 原地等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've located the thruster pod! Stand by!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.26,1:34:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点快点 步子迈大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on! Move them little legs!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.13,1:34:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进器的动力太强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thruster's way too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.50,1:34:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本抓不住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can hold on to it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.34,1:34:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽雯 你有办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liwen, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.45,1:34:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它焊到你们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can weld it to your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.78,1:34:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我升级了拳击手的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I upgraded Scrapper's weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.62,1:34:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮 我正打算那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. I was actually gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.19,1:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吹牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.56,1:34:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没吹牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.21,1:34:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got one shot at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.75,1:34:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那就一招制胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Then let's make it count.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.24,1:35:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.58,1:35:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.37,1:35:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们砸下时的分量能重一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an extra ton we can drop on that thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.38,1:35:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快要解体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.44,1:35:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.35,1:36:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在偏离轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're drifting off course!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.72,1:36:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射等离子炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the plasma cannon!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.02,1:36:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在解除安全协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengaging safety protocol!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.69,1:36:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等离子炮已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma cannon engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.84,1:36:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 超出结构强度极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Exceeding structural limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.08,1:36:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.98,1:36:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲结构损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Structural failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.35,1:36:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.99,1:36:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.69,1:36:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target locked!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.63,1:36:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 阿玛拉 快启动逃生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, Amara, you need to eject!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.91,1:36:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 断开连接 我能抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, disconnect! I will catch you!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.86,1:36:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.50,1:36:44.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（断开与驾驶员的连接）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.57,1:36:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.17,1:36:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪者呼叫指挥中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gipsy to Command,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.44,1:36:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将启动逃生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're getting the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.41,1:36:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃生舱 启动失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape pod failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.68,1:36:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.03,1:37:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, smallie.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.44,1:37:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.34,1:37:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.34,1:37:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲会骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.93,1:37:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrapper!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.50,1:37:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.11,1:37:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来 我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.21,1:37:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离撞击二十千米 快离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 kilometers to impact. Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.88,1:37:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.73,1:37:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来了 快关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in! Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.42,1:37:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.15,1:37:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am hanging on!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.24,1:37:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再抓紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tighter!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.90,1:38:36.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（死亡）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.24,1:38:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.99,1:38:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别太得意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.43,1:38:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划 我还有B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B. Always a plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.54,1:39:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员请注意 我是兰伯特战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who's listening, this is Ranger Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.25,1:39:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特刚才被逮住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, we just caught ourselves a Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.58,1:39:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 那是兰伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.62,1:39:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事太好了兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're still okay, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.13,1:39:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 兄弟 我知道你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too, brother. I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.83,1:39:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.47,1:39:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人帮了我不少忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a lot of help.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.44,1:39:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮 战士纳马尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Ranger Namani.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.98,1:39:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.26,1:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次看到雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen snow before.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.17,1:39:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下有那么多抓眼球的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So out of all the things to notice right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.61,1:39:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却只留意到了雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're noticing snow?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.43,1:39:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个被我们干掉的超级怪兽就在那里躺着 我不确定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big, dead Kaiju is just, is right there, and I'm not sure if…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.74,1:39:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.80,1:39:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是准备在这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the part where you're gonna give me…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.07,1:39:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来一场又臭又长的演讲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those big, dumb speeches, 'cause…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.48,1:39:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 大家都这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did everyone think it was dumb…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.65,1:39:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你对我的演讲有成见\N{\fnArial\fs30}or is that just your opinion…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.58,1:39:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己对着镜子练习了多少回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be honest, how many times did you practice that in front of the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.25,1:39:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是励志演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was motivational.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.66,1:39:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为你想成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be whoever you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.96,1:39:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开打 - 好吧 你现在想打雪仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - Okay. Oh, now you want to play that?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天生的好手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a natural at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.50,1:39:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是天生的好手 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not a natural because…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.83,1:39:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让着我点 我没玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break. I've never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.88,1:39:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,中招了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.45,1:40:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.00,1:40:14.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《环太平洋2：雷霆再起》
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.63,1:40:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is over, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.97,1:40:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你们拯救了蹩脚的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you've saved your crappy little world?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.21,1:40:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会善罢甘休\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna keep coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.91,1:40:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还会卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are never going to stop,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.45,1:40:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.75,1:40:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会被先驱者的铁蹄踏平\N{\fnArial\fs30}your luck is going to run out!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.03,1:40:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你脑子里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. The things in your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.21,1:40:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的先驱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Precursors?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.51,1:40:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 我们不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them we're not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.38,1:40:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们下次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell 'em, next time,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.78,1:40:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再劳烦他们大驾光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}they won't need to worry about coming for us,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.02,1:40:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会亲自上门拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're gonna come for them.
